# base-system/profiles/server.list — Server runtime profile
# Inherits minimal profile and adds networking, DNS, TLS, SSH, time sync, process monitoring
#
# Every entry below names a package the source-built stages actually produce.
# base-system/README.md requires that optional services are not claimed as
# installed until they have a pinned ShreeOS package/build recipe, so the
# packages that only exist in the Debian prototype prototype/ path are listed
# as comments: they are wanted for this profile, but the source build does
# not ship them yet.

# Include minimal base
@minimal

# Networking & Transport
iproute2
wpa_supplicant
curl
wget
openssl
# dhcpcd — the source build uses the BusyBox udhcpc client instead.
# ca-certificates — the source build has no CA bundle recipe yet.

# Time Synchronization & Cryptography
# chrony — no pinned ShreeOS package/build recipe yet.

# Remote Access & Daemons
# openssh — no pinned ShreeOS package/build recipe yet.

# Storage & Filesystem Management
kmod
# e2fsprogs, dosfstools — no pinned ShreeOS package/build recipe yet.
